@startuml polling-sequence
title OpenSky Ingestion Poller — Observed Interaction

skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #888888
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #CCCCCC
skinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #FAFAFA

actor Developer as dev

participant "ingestion-poller\n(poller.ts)" as Poller #DBEAFE
participant "OpenSky Network\nREST API" as OpenSky #D1FAE5
participant "Redpanda\nadsb.raw — Partition 0" as Broker #FEF9C3

== Startup ==

dev -> Poller : tsx src/poller.ts
Poller -> Broker : connect()\n+ version handshake
Broker --> Poller : connected

note right of Poller
  producer connected
  poller starting
  url: .../states/all?lamin=49&lomin=-8&lamax=61&lomax=10
  poll_interval_ms: 10000
end note

== Cycle 1 — fires immediately on startup ==

Poller -> OpenSky : GET /api/states/all?lamin=49&lomin=-8&lamax=61&lomax=10\nAbortSignal.timeout(8_000)
OpenSky --> Poller : 200 OK\n{"time": 1787261900, "states": [[...], ...]}

note right of Poller
  449 state vectors received.
  Each array entry mapped to a named AdsbRawEvent.
  fetched_at_ms = Date.now() appended to every record.
end note

Poller -> Broker : ProduceRequest (449 messages)\nkey: icao24, value: AdsbRawEvent JSON
Broker -> Broker : append to partition log\noffsets 0–448\nHIGH-WATERMARK: 0 → 449
Broker --> Poller : RecordMetadata\n(partition=0, first_offset="0")

note right of Poller
  poll cycle complete
  state_vectors: 449, topic: adsb.raw, first_offset: "0"
end note

Poller -> Poller : scheduleNextPoll()\nsetTimeout(10_000)

== Wait — 10 s interval + ~1 s fetch/publish latency ==

... ~11 s elapsed ...

== Cycle 2 ==

Poller -> OpenSky : GET /api/states/all (same bounding box)
OpenSky --> Poller : 200 OK\n{"time": 1787261910, "states": [[...], ...]}

note right of Poller
  449 state vectors received.
  Aircraft 471efa (WMT581): lon advanced +0.0186°, lat -0.0025°.
  time_position advanced from 1787261405 to 1787261410 (+5 s).
  Real movement — not a cached snapshot.
end note

Poller -> Broker : ProduceRequest (449 messages)\nkey: icao24, value: AdsbRawEvent JSON
Broker -> Broker : append to partition log\noffsets 449–897\nHIGH-WATERMARK: 449 → 898
Broker --> Poller : RecordMetadata\n(partition=0, first_offset="449")

note right of Poller
  poll cycle complete
  state_vectors: 449, topic: adsb.raw, first_offset: "449"
end note

Poller -> Poller : scheduleNextPoll()\nsetTimeout(10_000)

... ~11 s elapsed ...

== Cycle 3 ==

Poller -> OpenSky : GET /api/states/all (same bounding box)
OpenSky --> Poller : 200 OK\n449 → 446 aircraft (3 left the bounding box)

Poller -> Broker : ProduceRequest (446 messages)
Broker -> Broker : append to partition log\noffsets 898–1343\nHIGH-WATERMARK: 898 → 1344
Broker --> Poller : RecordMetadata\n(partition=0, first_offset="898")

Poller -> Poller : scheduleNextPoll()

== Graceful shutdown (SIGTERM received between cycles) ==

dev -> Poller : SIGTERM
Poller -> Poller : stopping = true\nclearTimeout(pollTimeout)

note right of Poller
  shutdown initiated, signal: SIGTERM
  In-flight setTimeout cancelled.
  No new poll cycle will be scheduled.
end note

Poller -> Broker : disconnect()
Broker --> Poller : disconnected

note right of Poller
  producer disconnected
  Process exits cleanly.
  HIGH-WATERMARK remains at 1344.
  LOG-START-OFFSET remains at 0 — all records available.
end note

@enduml
